(1. Topic Introduction) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Agile Software Development is an iterative and collaborative approach to project management and software delivery. Codified in) Tj
0 -12 Td
(the 2001 Agile Manifesto, it prioritizes working software, customer collaboration, and rapid responsiveness to requirement changes.) Tj
0 -12 Td
0 -7 Td
