/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(- Four Agile Manifesto Values: Individuals & interactions over processes; working software over comprehensive documentation;) Tj
0 -12 Td
(  customer collaboration over contract negotiation; responding to change over following a plan.) Tj
0 -12 Td
