(3. Detailed Explanations) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(In traditional Waterfall models, changing requirements mid-project incurs heavy financial and timeline penalties. Agile embraces) Tj
0 -12 Td
(change through small 2-week iterations. When stakeholders introduce a new priority \(such as a Discussion Forum\), the Product Owner) Tj
0 -12 Td
(evaluates effort and adjusts the backlog—deferring lower-priority scope to protect deadlines without burning out developers.) Tj
0 -12 Td
