(5. Key Takeaways) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(1. Agile delivers value incrementally through functional, tested software increments at the end of every sprint.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Embracing change requires disciplined trade-offs: swap scope in and out rather than extending fixed delivery dates.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Story points measure relative effort, complexity, and uncertainty rather than rigid hours.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. Retrospectives facilitate continuous team improvement by inspecting process friction and executing action items.) Tj
0 -12 Td
